  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        0,
        -12
      ],
      "id": 36,
      "text": "Sensors (SN-221). Run (F5), then drag a sensor up or down, or turn the wheel over it, to change what it measures:\nLM35: 10 mV/°C. NTC: the divider voltage falls as it warms. LDR: more light, higher voltage. A3144: a south pole above 20 mT lights the LED (released below 15 mT)."
    }
  ],
